era :the_orca_incursion do
  title "The Orca Incursion"
  source_id "the-orca-incursion"
  subkind :historical_period
  summary "The orcas come not as raiders but as conquerors, their war-pods striking with coordination that speaks of dark intelligence. Old feuds between the Aurora Stack and the Nightfall Shelf fade as colonies band together against extinction. The innovations of the previous age become weapons; the heroes of this era are defenders who hold the line at impossible odds. Every culture contributes what it knows best: Shelf shadow-craft and espionage, Stack mystical barriers, and the desperate courage of those with nowhere left to retreat."
